" end="00:17.520">is </span><span begin="00:17.520" end="00:17.580">a </span><span begin="00:17.580" end="00:18.090">place </span><span begin="00:18.090" end="00:18.420">for </span><span begin="00:18.420" end="00:18.660">what </span><span begin="00:18.660" end="00:18.810">we </span><span begin="00:18.810" end="00:19.740">tried </span><span begin="00:19.740" end="00:20.910">but</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.030" end="00:25.080"><span begin="00:21.030" end="00:21.420">Never </span><span begin="00:21.420" end="00:21.750">felt </span><span begin="00:21.750" end="00:22.110">so </span><span begin="00:22.110" end="00:22.770">wrong </span><span begin="00:22.770" end="00:22.890">in </span><span begin="00:22.890" end="00:23.070">my </span><span begin="00:23.070" end="00:23.880">mind </span><span begin="00:23.880" end="00:24.960">and</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.080" end="00:29.160"><span begin="00:25.080" end="00:25.440">Never </span><span begin="00:25.440" end="00:26.100">understood </span><span begin="00:26.100" end="00:26.460">why </span><span begin="00:26.460" end="00:26.790">Mama </span><span begin="00:26.790" end="00:27.630">cried </span><span begin="00:27.630" end="00:28.530">and</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.160" end="00:33.180"><span begin="00:29.160" end="00:29.430">Could </span><span begin="00:29.430" end="00:29.520">it </span><span begin="00:29.520" end="00:29.700">be </span><span begin="00:29.700" end="00:30.150">because </span><span begin="00:30.150" end="00:30.510">our </span><span begin="00:30.510" end="00:31.230">secret's </span><span begin="00:31.230" end="00:32.580">hiding</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.180" end="00:37.110"><span begin="00:33.180" end="00:33.420">I </span><span begin="00:33.420" end="00:33.750">always </span><span begin="00:33.750" end="00:34.140">thought </span><span begin="00:34.140" end="00:34.770">someday </span><span begin="00:34.770" end="00:34.950">you'd </span><span begin="00:34.950" end="